    <string name="setting_require_passcode_desc">Without this, anyone who can unlock your phone can open NiiX directly.</string>
    <string name="setting_disguise">Disguise as calculator</string>
    <string name="setting_disguise_desc">Shows a working calculator instead of NiiX\'s real icon and name.</string>
    <string name="setting_wipe_now">Wipe all data now</string>
    <string name="setting_wipe_now_desc">Immediately and permanently erases everything on this device.</string>
    <string name="warn_disable_passcode_title">Turn off passcode protection?</string>
    <string name="warn_disable_passcode_body">Without a passcode, anyone who can unlock your phone — with their fingerprint, face, or screen lock — can open NiiX directly and read your messages. Your data stays encrypted, but only as strongly as your phone\'s own lock screen, not by anything only you know.

Your duress code will stop working, since there\'s no passcode screen left to enter it into. You can wipe your data manually from Settings instead.</string>
    <string name="warn_disable_passcode_confirm">Turn Off Passcode</string>
    <string name="warn_disable_disguise_title">Turn off the calculator disguise?</string>
    <string name="warn_disable_disguise_body">NiiX will show its real icon and name everywhere — your app list, recent apps, and notifications. Anyone looking at your phone will be able to see this app exists and guess what it\'s for, even though they still can\'t open it without your passcode.

The icon change may take a moment to appear on your home screen — some launchers don\'t redraw it instantly, even though the change takes effect right away.</string>
    <string name="warn_disable_disguise_confirm">Turn Off Disguise</string>
    <string name="warn_disable_both_title">Turn off passcode — and the calculator disguise with it?</string>
    <string name="warn_disable_both_body">A calculator with nothing behind it can\'t hide anything, so turning off your passcode turns off the disguise too. NiiX will show its real icon and name, and anyone who can unlock your phone can open it directly and read your messages. Your duress code will stop working.

The icon change may take a moment to appear on your home screen — some launchers don\'t redraw it instantly, even though the change takes effect right away.</string>
    <string name="warn_disable_both_confirm">Turn Off Both</string>
    <string name="warn_enable_disguise_needs_passcode">The calculator disguise needs a passcode to mean anything — turn on \'Require a passcode\' first.</string>
    <string name="wipe_now_title">Wipe all data now?</string>
    <string name="wipe_now_body">This immediately and permanently deletes all messages, contacts, and keys on this device. This cannot be undone.</string>
    <string name="wipe_now_confirm">Wipe Everything</string>
    <string name="wipe_now_done">All data wiped.</string>
